b4d1767/uploads/origins/106dcfa1-8ed9-4462-8f25-7a1551bacb9c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c04cfee460bb06141431a336ad4f7315 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Sensei!\n\nI would like to follow-up on an appeal I received in December! I would like to have the chibi style artwork done of Penny Puffball! \n\nWould you be able to make:\n1- sleepy\n2- disgusted\n3- pouting\n4- drooling\n5- shocked expression\n\nReference sheet here:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OJzqeamcO2SqJecfraVgmSSNQ8NFIkAa?usp=sharing\nhttps://x.com/PennyPuffball\n\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sotoroa_0v0/works/164", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1aa844ec/uploads/origins/f36306fd-d0c9-418d-a9d7-fdfd740aa3bf?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9461384b518dde7db753aef2e6455d4a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1aa844ec/uploads/origins/f36306fd-d0c9-418d-a9d7-fdfd740aa3bf?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9461384b518dde7db753aef2e6455d4a, https://si.imgix.net/1aa844ec/uploads/origins/f36306fd-d0c9-418d-a9d7-fdfd740aa3bf?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22d7999ce8059c6e093941f4efec1f65 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1aa844ec/uploads/origins/f36306fd-d0c9-418d-a9d7-fdfd740aa3bf?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1e577ffdff193255d38e119de7b0937 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！Vtuberの小花衣ももみと申します。\n\nぜひ「Vtuber小花衣ももみのイラスト」をリクエストさせてください！\n\n■詳細■\n・使用用途：Vtuber活動での使用（配信サムネイル、SNSアイコンやヘッダー・告知など）\n・可能でしたらPSDファイルでキャラクターがレイヤーわけされているとうれしいです\n・上左右が画面から見切れていないと使用しやすくて助かります🙇\n\n・資料\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Z7R4ZDn\n※年齢は9歳、身長は139㎝なのでかなり幼めに描いて頂きたいです。\n\nよろしくおねがいします✨", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sotoroa_0v0/works/163", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1779274f/uploads/origins/345dc94b-700b-4b2a-b74e-f9259f378489?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=co